         "text": "Expand (-1 + h)^3 = -1 + 3h - 3h^2 + h^3, so the numerator is -1 + 3h - 3h^2 + h^3 + 2 - 2h - 1 = h - 3h^2 + h^3.",
         "mathjson": [
